ng to be denied  who do you model your game after  definitely christian mccaffrey my team  didn't really put me in a slight  receiver like that but i definitely can  catch the ball a lot so i definitely see  myself as him a player like him you know  and he runs tough can make people miss  and take the distance just just like me  what was the name of your high school in  texas lagrange all right we got some  lagrange highlights  of jk dobbins right here ready to go  uh you remember this one oh my gosh  there's a blur i guess that's you yeah  and he's gone he's loose as paul allen  would say  yeah you got the lsu uniforms i'm  surprised you didn't go to baton rouge  yeah yeah definitely close  uh you know it's funny i see these high  school highlights and i see guys that  they think have an angle  there's no angle there's never an angle  when you get that kind of speed  was there a moment when you got to ohio  state either on the practice field or  against an opponent where  it was basically welcome to this level  this isn't high school anymore uh yeah  definitely you know uh  my freshman year coming in you got guys  like nick bosa sam hubbard you know  taekwon lewis you got jerome baker you  got denzel award  those guys are on the defense and i was  practicing against those guys and you  know those are those are not bad  football players and it was definitely  like oh they can run they can run a  little faster you know and they can  they're a little bigger so but it was  definitely a great experience though you  know it's funny we talk all the time  about the sec and how competing in the  sec gets guys ready for the nfl ohio  state is like a mini sec when you think  of all the nfl players that come out of  that program and how like nick boson  scary he ran by us during the playoff  game and he wasn't even in pads and i  was scared i mean i can't imagine  practicing against a guy like that who  hit you the hardest at ohio state hit me  the hardest uh  drone baker you 