  you know get my hand placement right you  know just and work on footwork  techniques you know to finish my blocks  around my feet  how much of it is just sheer will or how  much of it is consciously thinking about  what you need to do  oh yeah blocking you definitely have to  mentally be there because  it's different you know it's definitely  different for a running back but  honestly you want to do it you have to  want to do it well my big takeaway is  there is a skill set in jk dobbins that  maybe we didn't get to fully appreciate  at the college level that someone is  going to benefit from if they decide to  throw the ball to jk dobbins out of the  back field and you know there's only  three members of the 1 000 yard rushing  and receiving club christian mccaffrey  is the newest one we could be looking at  number four we'll see how it plays out  we wish you all the best as you get  healthy have a great workout if you're  able to do it have a great pro day have  a great draft day and we look forward to  seeing the nfl jk sir thank you  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports

